        "Content": "•Exclusive cul-de-sac development of just 14 family homes\r\n\r\n•Highly sought-after Howth location, just above the Village and Harbour\r\n\r\n•Conveniently located off Thormanby Road\r\n\r\n•East Cliff walks and pathways virtually on the doorstep\r\n\r\n•Easy access to Howth Summit and coastal walks\r\n\r\n•Impressive detached family home extending to approx. 208 sq. m.\r\n\r\n•Five spacious bedrooms, two with ensuite facilities\r\n\r\n•Versatile attic room accessed via spiral staircase\r\n\r\n•Two reception rooms including a living room and family TV room\r\n\r\n•Generous open-plan kitchen/dining room\r\n\r\n•Bright rear sunroom overlooking the garden\r\n\r\n•Utility room with convenient side access\r\n\r\n•Private rear garden with patio and lawn\r\n\r\n•EV (electric car charger)\r\n\r\n•South West facing rear garden\r\n\r\n•Generous paved front driveway with mature planting\r\n\r\n•Close to Howth Village, Harbour, schools and sporting clubs\r\n\r\n•Excellent opportunity to acquire a substantial family home in a prime coastal setting\r\n\r\n•Viewing highly recommended"
